{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-cutoff-parametrix-error-derivatives","title":"lem:chow-iii-cutoff-parametrix-error-derivatives","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.md","line":110,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex#lem:chow-iii-cutoff-parametrix-error-derivatives","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-approximate-kernel-error-derivatives]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex","label":"lem:chow-iii-cutoff-parametrix-error-derivatives","line":216,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Derivatives of \\(L_{x,\\tau}P_N\\)]\n\\label{lem:chow-iii-cutoff-parametrix-error-derivatives}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0293}\n\\uses{prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix, lem:chow-iii-approximate-kernel-error-derivatives}\n\\dcref{ch24:24.12}\n\\group{Global Parametrix}\n\n\nFor smooth covariant tensors \\(G_{k,\\ell}\\),\n\\[\n \\partial_\\tau^\\ell\\nabla_x^k(L_{x,\\tau}P_N)\n =(\\tau-v)^{N-n/2-k-2\\ell}\n e^{-d_\\tau^2(x,y)/(5(\\tau-v))}G_{k,\\ell}.\n\\]\nIn particular,\n\\[\n |L_{x,\\tau}P_N|\\le C_0(\\tau-v)^{N-n/2}\n e^{-d_\\tau^2(x,y)/(5(\\tau-v))}.\n\\]\n\\end{lemma}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Derivatives of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$L_{x,\\tau }P_N$\">$L_{x,\\tau }P_N$</span>] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a63686f772d6969692d6375746f66662d706172616d65747269782d6572726f722d6465726976617469766573\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\"